# Observed on Claude Code 2.1.329: its Grep tool honours this file, so a Grep rooted at an ancestor of .claude/plans skips plan files.
# A Grep rooted at .claude/plans itself reads them.
# Its Glob and Read tools do not consult this file.
# git grep does not consult this file.
.claude/plans/
# The evidence/ line below hides a verbatim study copy from Grep, so a Grep rooted above it skips it.
# A redaction or leak sweep must use git grep, or root its Grep at each directory this file lists.
docs/reports/2026-11-19-comment-docstring-study/evidence/
